            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/bday-cake.png" alt="Birthday Cake milkshake">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Birthday Cake</h4>
                    <p>A velvety blend of yellow cake, sweet cream, and rainbow sprinkles. Sip your slice of cake and let the celebration begin!</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/peppermint.png" alt="Peppermint Bark Float">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-body">
                    <h4>Peppermint Bark Float</h4>
                    <p>Peppermint bark ice cream, cocoa, and dark chocolate over whole milk.</p>
                    <a href="/milkshakes" class="btn">View Recipe</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="recipe">
                <div class="recipe-media">
                    <img src="/mint.png" alt="Mint Chocolate Chip milkshake">
                </div>
